== Dokploy templates (server/templates/*, `upstream` in each template.toml) ==

Templates marked `upstream = "Dokploy/templates@6313a2e ..."` are converted from the blueprints of
https://github.com/Dokploy/templates. Each one's path in that repository is in its template.toml
and in server/templates/IMPORT_REPORT.md.

